1.This: apply_crossvalidation_hypertunning_feb25_modi2.py will give: top_predictions_uniquegenes.xlsx
2. Apply: merge_two_excel.py to get information of proteomes and prediction: input: human_unique_proteome_all_0.4.xlsx and uniprot json files. output: merged_result_uniquegenes_human.xlsx

Note: This will add CDD annotation also

The human_unique_proteome_all_0.4.xlsx is generated using: get_unique_humanproteome_input.py from src_strand folder 

3. Tandeem Igs: tandem_ig_together.py take input as merged_result_uniquegenes_human.xlsx> output: final_paired_igdomains.xlsx,

4. To get the chain architecture: run chain_architecture_together.py: input file is from above; merged_result_uniquegenes_human.xlsx

5. To get the statistics of chain architecture:

run: statistics_chain_architecture.py


4.  CDD domain annotation: to run CDD annotation use: run_one_ids_cdd_annotation.py in src_residue_esmfoldfeatures


For genes starting anlysis based on TCR and BCR: run tcr_ig_imgt_genesanalysis.py. Input is chain architecture 
